Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Asset Publisher,Highest Rated Assets|
		|testray.main.component.name|Highest Rated Assets|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Assert Highest Rateded Asset
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	When Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test Page 1|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test Page 2|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page 1|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet configure Display Settings
		|displaySettings|Ratings|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page 2|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Highest Rated Assets|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet configure Display Settings
		|displaySettings|Ratings|
		|portletName|Highest Rated Assets|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page 1|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentContent|Web Content Content|
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title 1|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentContent|Web Content Content|
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title 2|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page 1|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Asset Details PG
		|assetContent|Web Content Content|
		|assetTitle|Web Content Title 1|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet rate Asset PG
		|rating|3|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page 2|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Asset Details PG
		|assetContent|Web Content Content|
		|assetTitle|Web Content Title 2|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet rate Asset PG
		|rating|5|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page 2|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Asset Details PG
		|assetContent|Web Content Content|
		|assetTitle|Web Content Title 1|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Asset Rating PG
